# GitHub personal access token (optional).
# Used server-side only, inside /api/github.js, to raise GitHub's API rate
# limit from 60/hr (unauthenticated) to 5,000/hr (authenticated).
#
# - Fine-grained or classic token with no special scopes needed for public
#   repo metadata (read-only "public_repo"/"metadata" scope is enough).
# - Leave this blank and the endpoint still works unauthenticated.
# - NEVER prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or otherwise expose it to the client.
# - Set the real value in Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
